  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1564\">\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1471\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1361\">Helps identify <strong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1349\">neuromuscular disorders</strong>, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1471\">\n<li data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1383\"><strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1383\">Radiculopathy</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1413\">\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1413\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1413\">Peripheral neuropathy</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1430\"><strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1430\">Myopathy</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1471\">\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1471\">Motor neuron disease (e.g., ALS)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1564\">\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1564\">Findings are correlated with <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1524\">clinical symptoms</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1563\">Nerve Conduction Studies (NCS)</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
